        408.278076171875,
        129.27297973632812
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis of  , although the frequency with which this occurs varies (21–23). Thus, even",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Italic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.095096588134766,
        132.26998901367188,
        408.27783203125,
        141.26998901367188
      ],
      "text": "contacts who have had TB should be evaluated again if they are exposed to an infectious case.",
