      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.10409927368164,
        150.26998901367188,
        408.3317565917969,
        159.26998901367188
      ],
      "text": "In three recent systematic reviews (24–26), the impact of the commonly investigated risk",
