      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.15810012817383,
        162.26699829101562,
        408.17877197265625,
        171.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "factors for clustering of TB cases was estimated, with stratiﬁcation by TB incidence (with 25",
