    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.00498580932617,
        174.27304077148438,
        408.16107177734375,
        183.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "per 100 000 cases per year as the cut-off between low and high or intermediate incidence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.9959831237793,
        186.27005004882812,
        410.1406555175781,
        195.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "settings). A meta-analysis showed signiﬁcant estimated odds ratios for several risk factors",
