    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.013980865478516,
        198.26705932617188,
        408.16961669921875,
        207.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "at both levels of TB incidence. Alcohol abuse, injection drug use and homelessness were",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.00497817993164,
        210.26406860351562,
        408.2059631347656,
        219.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "consistently, signiﬁcantly associated with TB in settings with a low incidence.The authors",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        51.031978607177734,
        222.27008056640625,
        408.4576721191406,
        231.27008056640625
      ],
