      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.718196868896484,
        324.266845703125,
        407.9371032714844,
        333.266845703125
      ],
      "text": "identiﬁed, “Why was the case not prevented by treatment for LTBI?” Molecular epidemiology",
