      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        50.7631950378418,
        336.26385498046875,
        408.2790832519531,
        345.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "has not been used in this manner in high-incidence settings. Perhaps, as mycobacterial culture",
